{"id":"t4-hafazan","tahap":"T4","nama":"Hafazan (KAFA)","sk":"Hafazan","ikon":"📖","warna":"#7A5AB8","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 4 (hafazan Juz 'Amma)","semak":"pending ustaz review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.67","sumber":"Year 4 hafazan surahs; Quran text from the app's KFGQPC Uthmani data; meanings are short summaries pending an ustaz's review; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t4-hafazan-1","nama":"Surah Asy-Syams","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-91 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai lima belas ayat (15 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Matahari"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Asy-Syams"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلشَّمْسِ وَضُحَـٰهَا</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَـٰهَا</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّـٰهَا</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَـٰهَا</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا بَنَـٰهَا</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَحَـٰهَا</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَنَفْسٍ وَمَا سَوَّٮٰهَا</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقْوَٮٰهَا</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن زَكَّـٰهَا</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَقَدْ خَابَ مَن دَسَّـٰهَا</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَٮٰهَآ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذِ ٱنۢبَعَثَ أَشْقَـٰهَا</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ نَاقَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَسُقْيَـٰهَا</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُم بِذَنۢبِهِمْ فَسَوَّٮٰهَا</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقْبَـٰهَا</span> (15)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Allah bersumpah dengan matahari, bulan, siang, malam, langit, bumi dan jiwa manusia. Allah mengilhamkan kepada jiwa jalan kejahatan dan ketakwaan. Berjayalah orang yang menyucikan jiwanya dan rugilah orang yang mengotorinya, seperti kaum Thamud yang membunuh unta Nabi Salih."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita menyucikan jiwa dengan amalan baik","Orang yang mengotori jiwanya akan rugi","Kaum yang derhaka akan dibinasakan"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Asy-Syams","Maksudnya: Matahari."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-2","nama":"Surah Al-Balad","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-90 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai dua puluh ayat (20 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Negeri"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Balad"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَنتَ حِلُّۢ بِهَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَوَالِدٍ وَمَا وَلَدَ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ فِى كَبَدٍ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّن يَقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَدٌ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَقُولُ أَهْلَكْتُ مَالاً لُّبَدًا</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّمْ يَرَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَلَمْ نَجْعَل لَّهُۥ عَيْنَيْنِ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلِسَانًا وَشَفَتَيْنِ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَهَدَيْنَـٰهُ ٱلنَّجْدَيْنِ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَلَا ٱقْتَحَمَ ٱلْعَقَبَةَ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَآ أَدْرَٮٰكَ مَا ٱلْعَقَبَةُ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَكُّ رَقَبَةٍ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَوْ إِطْعَـٰمٌ فِى يَوْمٍ ذِى مَسْغَبَةٍ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَتِيمًا ذَا مَقْرَبَةٍ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَوْ مِسْكِينًا ذَا مَتْرَبَةٍ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ كَانَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَتَوَاصَوْاْ بِٱلصَّبْرِ وَتَوَاصَوْاْ بِٱلْمَرْحَمَةِ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ بِـَٔـايَـٰتِنَا هُمْ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْمَشْــَٔمَةِ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَلَيْهِمْ نَارٌ مُّؤْصَدَةُۢ</span> (20)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Allah bersumpah dengan negeri Mekah. Manusia dicipta dalam keadaan susah payah. Allah memberi manusia dua mata, lidah dan dua bibir serta menunjukkan dua jalan. Jalan yang mendaki ialah membebaskan hamba, memberi makan anak yatim dan orang miskin, beriman dan berpesan dengan sabar dan kasih sayang."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita memberi makan anak yatim dan orang miskin","Kita berpesan-pesan dengan sabar dan kasih sayang","Allah memberi kita nikmat mata, lidah dan bibir"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Balad","Maksudnya: Negeri."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-3","nama":"Surah Al-Fajr","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-89 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai tiga puluh ayat (30 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Waktu fajar"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Fajr"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْفَجْرِ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلَيَالٍ عَشْرٍ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلشَّفْعِ وَٱلْوَتْرِ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَسْرِ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ فِى ذَٰلِكَ قَسَمٌ لِّذِى حِجْرٍ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِعَادٍ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِرَمَ ذَاتِ ٱلْعِمَادِ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّتِى لَمْ يُخْلَقْ مِثْلُهَا فِى ٱلْبِلَـٰدِ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَثَمُودَ ٱلَّذِينَ جَابُواْ ٱلصَّخْرَ بِٱلْوَادِ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَفِرْعَوْنَ ذِى ٱلْأَوْتَادِ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِينَ طَغَوْاْ فِى ٱلْبِلَـٰدِ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَكْثَرُواْ فِيهَا ٱلْفَسَادَ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَصَبَّ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّكَ سَوْطَ عَذَابٍ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَبِٱلْمِرْصَادِ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَمَّا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِذَا مَا ٱبْتَلَـٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ فَأَكْرَمَهُۥ وَنَعَّمَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّىٓ أَكْرَمَنِ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَمَّآ إِذَا مَا ٱبْتَلَـٰهُ فَقَدَرَ عَلَيْهِ رِزْقَهُۥ فَيَقُولُ رَبِّىٓ أَهَـٰنَنِ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّا‌ۖ بَل لَّا تُكْرِمُونَ ٱلْيَتِيمَ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلَا تَحَـٰٓضُّونَ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَتَأْكُلُونَ ٱلتُّرَاثَ أَكْلاً لَّمًّا</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَتُحِبُّونَ ٱلْمَالَ حُبًّا جَمًّا</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّآ إِذَا دُكَّتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ دَكًّا دَكًّا</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجَآءَ رَبُّكَ وَٱلْمَلَكُ صَفًّا صَفًّا</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجِاْىٓءَ يَوْمَئِذِۭ بِجَهَنَّمَ‌ۚ يَوْمَئِذٍ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ وَأَنَّىٰ لَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَقُولُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى قَدَّمْتُ لِحَيَاتِى</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَيَوْمَئِذٍ لَّا يُعَذِّبُ عَذَابَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَلَا يُوثِقُ وَثَاقَهُۥٓ أَحَدٌ</span> (26)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَـٰٓأَيَّتُهَا ٱلنَّفْسُ ٱلْمُطْمَئِنَّةُ</span> (27)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱرْجِعِىٓ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكِ رَاضِيَةً مَّرْضِيَّةً</span> (28)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَٱدْخُلِى فِى عِبَـٰدِى</span> (29)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱدْخُلِى جَنَّتِى</span> (30)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Allah bersumpah dengan waktu fajar dan sepuluh malam. Allah membinasakan kaum 'Ad, Thamud dan Firaun yang melampaui batas. Manusia diuji dengan kesenangan dan kesusahan. Pada hari kiamat jiwa yang tenang dipanggil masuk ke dalam syurga."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita bersyukur ketika senang dan sabar ketika susah","Kita memuliakan anak yatim","Jiwa yang tenang akan masuk ke dalam syurga"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Fajr","Maksudnya: Waktu fajar."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-4","nama":"Surah Al-Ghasyiyah","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-88 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai dua puluh enam ayat (26 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Hari kiamat yang menyelubungi"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Ghasyiyah"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ أَتَـٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلْغَـٰشِيَةِ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ خَـٰشِعَةٌ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَامِلَةٌ نَّاصِبَةٌ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">تَصْلَىٰ نَارًا حَامِيَةً</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">تُسْقَىٰ مِنْ عَيْنٍ ءَانِيَةٍ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّيْسَ لَهُمْ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِن ضَرِيعٍ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّا يُسْمِنُ وَلَا يُغْنِى مِن جُوعٍ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ نَّاعِمَةٌ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لِّسَعْيِهَا رَاضِيَةٌ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِى جَنَّةٍ عَالِيَةٍ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّا تَسْمَعُ فِيهَا لَـٰغِيَةً</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِيهَا عَيْنٌ جَارِيَةٌ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِيهَا سُرُرٌ مَّرْفُوعَةٌ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَكْوَابٌ مَّوْضُوعَةٌ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَنَمَارِقُ مَصْفُوفَةٌ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَزَرَابِىُّ مَبْثُوثَةٌ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى ٱلْإِبِلِ كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيْفَ رُفِعَتْ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِلَى ٱلْجِبَالِ كَيْفَ نُصِبَتْ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَإِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ كَيْفَ سُطِحَتْ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَذَكِّرْ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٌ</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَيُعَذِّبُهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَكْبَرَ</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ إِلَيْنَآ إِيَابَهُمْ</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا حِسَابَهُم</span> (26)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Hari kiamat menyelubungi manusia. Ada wajah yang hina dan letih, dimasukkan ke dalam neraka. Ada wajah yang berseri-seri di dalam syurga yang tinggi. Perhatikanlah unta, langit, gunung dan bumi sebagai tanda kebesaran Allah."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita memerhati ciptaan Allah","Hari kiamat pasti berlaku","Orang beriman akan berseri-seri di dalam syurga"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Ghasyiyah","Maksudnya: Hari kiamat yang menyelubungi."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-5","nama":"Surah Al-A'la","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-87 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai sembilan belas ayat (19 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Yang Maha Tinggi"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-A'la"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">سَبِّحِ ٱسْمَ رَبِّكَ ٱلْأَعْلَى</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّذِى قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَخْرَجَ ٱلْمَرْعَىٰ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَجَعَلَهُۥ غُثَآءً أَحْوَىٰ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">سَنُقْرِئُكَ فَلَا تَنسَىٰٓ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ‌ۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعْلَمُ ٱلْجَهْرَ وَمَا يَخْفَىٰ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَشْقَى</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِى يَصْلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحْيَىٰ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَذَكَرَ ٱسْمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بَلْ تُؤْثِرُونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْأَخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَفِى ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلْأُولَىٰ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ</span> (19)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Sucikanlah nama Tuhanmu Yang Maha Tinggi, yang mencipta dan menyempurnakan ciptaan-Nya. Berjayalah orang yang menyucikan diri, mengingati nama Tuhannya lalu bersolat. Akhirat lebih baik dan lebih kekal daripada dunia."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita bertasbih memuji Allah","Akhirat lebih baik dan lebih kekal","Kita menyucikan diri dan bersolat"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-A'la","Maksudnya: Yang Maha Tinggi."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-6","nama":"Surah At-Tariq","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-86 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai tujuh belas ayat (17 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Yang datang pada waktu malam"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah At-Tariq"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَآ أَدْرَٮٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍ دَافِقٍ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلَا نَاصِرٍ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌ فَصْلٌ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدَۢا</span> (17)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Allah bersumpah dengan langit dan bintang yang bersinar terang. Setiap jiwa ada malaikat yang menjaganya. Manusia dicipta daripada air yang memancar. Al-Quran ialah kata pemutus antara yang benar dengan yang salah."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Setiap jiwa dijaga oleh malaikat","Al-Quran membezakan yang benar dan yang salah","Allah berkuasa menghidupkan semula manusia"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["At-Tariq","Maksudnya: Yang datang pada waktu malam."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-7","nama":"Surah Al-Buruj","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-85 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai dua puluh dua ayat (22 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Gugusan bintang"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah Al-Buruj"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلْبُرُوجِ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْمَوْعُودِ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَشَاهِدٍ وَمَشْهُودٍ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">قُتِلَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْأُخْدُودِ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلنَّارِ ذَاتِ ٱلْوَقُودِ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذْ هُمْ عَلَيْهَا قُعُودٌ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَهُمْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَفْعَلُونَ بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ شُهُودٌ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا نَقَمُواْ مِنْهُمْ إِلَّآ أَن يُؤْمِنُواْ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَمِيدِ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ‌ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدٌ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ فَتَنُواْ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُواْ فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ ٱلْحَرِيقِ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٌ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ‌ۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْكَبِيرُ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ بَطْشَ رَبِّكَ لَشَدِيدٌ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ يُبْدِئُ وَيُعِيدُ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَهُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلْوَدُودُ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ذُو ٱلْعَرْشِ ٱلْمَجِيدُ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَعَّالٌ لِّمَا يُرِيدُ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ أَتَـٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلْجُنُودِ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِرْعَوْنَ وَثَمُودَ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ فِى تَكْذِيبٍ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱللَّهُ مِن وَرَآئِهِم مُّحِيطُۢ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بَلْ هُوَ قُرْءَانٌ مَّجِيدٌ</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِى لَوْحٍ مَّحْفُوظِۭ</span> (22)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Allah bersumpah dengan langit yang mempunyai gugusan bintang. Orang yang menyeksa orang beriman di dalam parit api akan dilaknat. Orang beriman dan beramal soleh mendapat syurga. Al-Quran yang mulia terpelihara di Luh Mahfuz."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Orang beriman tetap teguh walaupun diseksa","Allah membalas orang yang zalim","Al-Quran terpelihara di Luh Mahfuz"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["Al-Buruj","Maksudnya: Gugusan bintang."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t4-hafazan-8","nama":"Ulang kaji hafazan Tahun 4","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Surah yang dihafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Asy-Syams: 15 ayat","Al-Balad: 20 ayat","Al-Fajr: 30 ayat","Al-Ghasyiyah: 26 ayat","Al-A'la: 19 ayat","At-Tariq: 17 ayat","Al-Buruj: 22 ayat"]},{"j":"h","t":"Tahukah anda?"},{"j":"l","t":["Nabi Muhammad SAW selalu membaca Surah al-A'la dan al-Ghasyiyah dalam solat Jumaat dan hari raya","Surah al-Fajr menyebut jiwa yang tenang"]}],"glosari":[["Hafaz","Ingat bacaan tanpa melihat."],["Tartil","Membaca dengan perlahan dan betul."]]}]}